com/photo/123684071.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/easier-than-dc-trump-suggests-national-guard-deployment-in-new-orleans-vows-to-fix-city-in-two-weeks/articleshow/123684071.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/easier-than-dc-trump-suggests-national-guard-deployment-in-new-orleans-vows-to-fix-city-in-two-weeks/articleshow/123684071.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-04T00:28:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123684108,imgsize-940087.cms"/></item><item><title>Matthew Perry death: ‘Ketamine Queen’ pleads guilty to supplying fatal drugs; faces up to 65 years</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123682913.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/matthew-perry-death-ketamine-queen-pleads-guilty-to-supplying-fatal-drugs-faces-up-to-65-years/articleshow/123682913.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/matthew-perry-death-ketamine-queen-pleads-guilty-to-supplying-fatal-drugs-faces-up-to-65-years/articleshow/123682913.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-03T23:32:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123683050,imgsize-834873.cms"/></item><item><title>'First time in history': Trump offers more US military presence in Poland; calls conflict in Ukraine 'stupid war'</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123682218.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/first-time-in-history-trump-offers-more-us-military-presence-in-poland-calls-conflict-in-ukraine-stupid-war/articleshow/123682218.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/first-time-in-history-trump-offers-more-us-military-presence-in-poland-calls-conflict-in-ukraine-stupid-war/articleshow/123682218.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-03T22:49:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123682295,imgsize-1050538.cms"/></item><item><title>Oman’s Golden Visa: Unlock new investment opportunities in real estate, companies, bonds, and job creation</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123681889.cms" /&gt;Oman’s Golden Visa offers long-term residency through diverse investment options, including real estate, company shares, government bonds, and job creation. With clear eligibility criteria and tiered residency durations (5 or 10 years), the program supports economic diversification and family inclusion. Applications are processed via Migrate World, providing a transparent, flexible pathway for investors aligned with Oman’s Vision 2040 goals.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/omans-golden-visa-unlock-new-investment-opportunities-in-real-estate-companies-bonds-and-job-creation/articleshow/123681889.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/omans-golden-visa-unlock-new-investment-opportunities-in-real-estate-companies-bonds-and-job-creation/articleshow/123681889.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-03T22:28:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123681982,imgsize-1019220.cms"/></item><item><title>'Democrat hoax': Trump rejects push to release more Epstein files; calls effort distraction from his success in office</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123681714.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/democrat-hoax-trump-rejects-push-to-release-more-epstein-files-calls-effort-distraction-from-his-success-in-office/articleshow/123681714.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/democrat-hoax-trump-rejects-push-to-release-more-epstein-files-calls-effort-distraction-from-his-success-in-office/articleshow/123681714.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-03T22:10:47+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123681741,imgsize-879478.cms"/></item><item><title>'Tariff foreign remote workers': Is Peter Navarro supporting 'outsourcing tax' after 'profiteering Brahmins' remark?</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123681166.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/tariff-foreign-remote-workers-is-peter-navarro-supporting-outsourcing-tax-after-profiteering-brahmins-remark/articleshow/123681166.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/tariff-foreign-remote-workers-is-peter-navarro-supporting-outsourcing-tax-after-profiteering-brahmins-remark/articleshow/123681166.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-03T21:25:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123681159,imgsize-30048.cms"/></item><item><title>'Will face same fate': Hegseth's warning after US strike kills 11 on Venezuelan drug boat; claims more hits will follow</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123681073.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/will-face-same-fate-hegseths-warning-after-us-strike-kills-11-on-venezuelan-drug-boat-claims-more-hits-will-follow/articleshow/123681073.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/will-face-same-fate-hegseths-warning-after-us-strike-kills-11-on-venezuelan-drug-boat-claims-more-hits-will-follow/articleshow/123681073.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-03T21:17:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123681096,imgsize-974681.cms"/></item><item><title>Painted as 'terrorists &amp; criminals': Afghan refugees expelled from Pakistan; despite weekend's deadly earthquake</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123680150.cms" /&gt;Pakistan is forcing out thousands of registered Afghan refugees amidst a humanitarian crisis in Afghanistan, triggered by a recent devastating earthquake. Despite holding official UN registration, families are fleeing due to fear of arrest and harassment, exacerbating the challenges faced by a nation already grappling with immense loss and destruction.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/painted-as-terrorists-criminals-afghan-refugees-expelled-from-pakistan-despite-weekends-deadly-earthquake/articleshow/123680150.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/painted-as-terrorists-criminals-afghan-refugees-expelled-from-pakistan-despite-weekends-deadly-earthquake/articleshow/123680150.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-03T19:57:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123680884,imgsize-107216.cms"/></item><item><title>Private toilet, sealed DNA: Kim Jong Un's secret lavatory on Beijing trip — Why aides wipe rooms after meetings</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123680634.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/private-toilet-sealed-dna-kim-jong-uns-secret-lavatory-on-beijing-trip-why-aides-wipe-rooms-after-meetings/articleshow/123680634.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/private-toilet-sealed-dna-kim-jong-uns-secret-lavatory-on-beijing-trip-why-aides-wipe-rooms-after-meetings/articleshow/123680634.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-03T20:41:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123680652,imgsize-940527.cms"/></item><item><title>Epstein video: New footage shows 'missing minute'; was there a cover-up bid?</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123680317.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/epstein-video-new-footage-shows-missing-minute-was-there-a-cover-up-bid/articleshow/123680317.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/epstein-video-new-footage-shows-missing-minute-was-there-a-cover-up-bid/articleshow/123680317.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-03T20:19:03+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123680376,imgsize-428907.cms"/></item><item><title>Rule forever? What Putin, Xi hot-mic moment revealed</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123678680.cms" /&gt;A hot-mic moment captured Russian President Vladimir Putin and Chinese President Xi Jinping discussing biotechnology's potential to extend human life, possibly up to 150 years, with North Korean President Kim Jong Un observing. The exchange occurred during a military parade in Beijing, where Xi warned of a global crossroads between peace and war while showcasing China's military strength.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/putin-xi-rare-hot-mic-moment-with-kim-present-leaders-discuss-immortality-watch/articleshow/123678680.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/putin-xi-rare-hot-mic-moment-with-kim-present-leaders-discuss-immortality-watch/articleshow/123678680.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-03T18:39:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123679469,imgsize-1394412.cms"/></item><item><title>UAE: Etihad to launch 100 Mbps in-flight wi-fi across fleet in three years; reports AED 1.1 billion profit in H1 2025</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123674845.cms" /&gt;Etihad Airways aims to deliver 100 Mbps in-flight Wi-Fi fleetwide within three years, enhancing passenger experience. The airline posted a strong AED 1.1 billion profit in the first half of 2025, fueled by 17% passenger growth, a fleet exceeding 100 aircraft, and 27 new destinations. With ongoing hires and expansions, Etihad continues to strengthen its global position amid economic uncertainties.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/uae-etihad-to-launch-100-mbps-in-flight-wi-fi-across-fleet-in-three-years-reports-aed-1-1-billion-profit-in-h1-2025/articleshow/123674845.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/uae-etihad-to-launch-100-mbps-in-flight-wi-fi-across-fleet-in-three-years-reports-aed-1-1-billion-profit-in-h1-2025/articleshow/123674845.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-03T18:51:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123679305,imgsize-1024220.cms"/></item></channel></rss>